{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VD7dKbrVFMnQAVZ3EHZDnh","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# solver-trace-ablation — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 22:16 UTC | 更新原因: Kill Criteria #4 量化阈值（Reviewer 建议）：3-seed mean < 25% AND last100 slope ≤ 0\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nSTA（Solver Trace Ablation）：首次将 mutation testing RIP 框架系统性引入 RL reward design，为 neurosymbolic formalizer 的 GRPO 训练提供 intensional verification reward。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-13 部分通过——STA 机制有效但训练集成权重需调整）\\\\n- **基础设施**: westd-39279 × 2 RTX PRO 6000 96GB ✅\\\\n- **MVP 结论**: full STA 连续 ISR 有区分力（GT=0.56 vs model=0.064）；但 50/50 权重导致 prove_rate 退化至 baseline 以下（0.10 < 0.12）；O(1) fast_isr 无效\\\\n- **MVP Pass**: #1✅ #2✅ #3✅ #4❌(ISR指标不可比) #5❌(accuracy差5pp+退化) | Kill criteria 未触发\\\\n- **⚠️ 因果归因未定**: ISR/PR 下降可能是检测 hacking 也可能是 STA 权重惩罚效应，plan_003 是消歧实验（D005）\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260513T215750 pending\\\\n- **Agent 状态**: 正在处理，队列有 P0 训练指令待执行\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划摘要（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n- **P0**（~13h）: FOL 500步×3seed + eval + O(1)vsO(N) + weight ablation\\\\n- **P1**（~8h）: Prolog + multi-logic + SFT baseline + hacking annotation\\\\n- **P2**（~9h）: SMT-LIB + 8B scaling\\\\n- **Pivotal**: plan_003（因果消歧）+ plan_005（weight ablation）共同决定 \\\\\\\"STA as reward\\\\\\\" vs \\\\\\\"STA as monitor\\\\\\\" 叙事\\\\n\\\\n## Research Phase Kill Criteria\\\\n1. plan_005 所有权重配比（0.1/0.2/0.3 + bonus mode + curriculum）均无法让 exec+STA ≥ exec-only → 论文退化为 \\\\\\\"STA as monitoring metric\\\\\\\"，claim 力度大幅减弱，与用户讨论是否继续\\\\n2. plan_001/002（500步3seed）STA 条件一致性差于 exec-only → 同上\\\\n3. plan_003 held-out eval 确认 ISR/PR 下降但非 hacking（人工标注 plan_012 无 shortcut 证据）→ \\\\\\\"检测 hacking\\\\\\\" claim 不成立，需重写 story\\\\n4. plan_001 exec-only 500步 prove_rate 未达阈值 → GRPO+exec reward 本身未产生提升，问题在基座训练而非 STA，需重新评估整个 GRPO pipeline\\\\n   - **硬阈值**: 3-seed 均值 prove_rate < 25%（baseline 12% 的 ~2倍）**且** last-100-step prove_rate 趋势斜率 ≤ 0（不再上升）\\\\n   - 两个条件同时满足才触发 kill；若均值 < 25% 但斜率仍正（仍在学习），延长到 800 步再判\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务（GPU 排列）\\\\n- [ ] cuda:0 → plan_001: exec-only 500步 seed=42（baseline + Kill Criteria #4）\\\\n- [ ] cuda:1 → plan_003: exec-only checkpoint full STA eval（消歧，eval-only 快速）→ 完成后 plan_005: sta_weight=0.1 训练\\\\n- [ ] 并行准备: Prolog STA instantiation + SFT baseline 数据\\\\n- [ ] Dream 回调后评估 framing/plan 是否调整\\\\n- [ ] registry 修正: exec-sta-r5 conclusion → \\\\\\\"negative\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 本地: westd-39279 × 2 RTX PRO 6000 96GB（cuda:0, cuda:1）\\\\n- 云: 暂不需要\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-13 | paper_framing.md \\\\\\\"检测 hacking\\\\\\\" claim 降级为观察性表述，plan_ | sta-phase1-exec-sta-r5, plan_003 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-13 | ISR/PR 下降因果归因待验证，plan_003 提升为最高优先级消歧实验 | sta-phase1-exec-sta-r5, sta-phase1-exec-only-r5 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-13 | Reviewer 指出 exec-sta-r5 prove_rate 低于 baseline（退化） | sta-phase1-exec-sta-r5, sta-phase1-exec-only-r5 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-13 | Phase 1 r4 fast_isr_fol 训练信号无效，改用 full STA + K=8 重 | sta-phase1-exec-only-r4, sta-phase1-exec-sta-r4 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 方案调整：50步→100步 + 趋势判断 + Phase 0 ISR baseline +  | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 方案：FOL+Prover9 单逻辑 50-step GRPO pilot 验证 STA r | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2869, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UTmoRLCTwY32YsWvSfRvvC","session_id":"c0563a1f-a2e2-46fc-bceb-71d67853ad00","uuid":"2c432c0d-a82b-4e3e-b937-9e10abc2afaf","timestamp":"2026-05-13T22:42:53.340Z"}
