{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Lz7HxYFDP63ziFKjAkYzsD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both independent reviews are complete. Now conducting the roundtable (Steps 2-4: cross-sharing, convergence, synthesis) and writing the final report.\n\n**Step 2 — Cross-sharing summary:**\n- R1 (Methods/Experiments): 3/6, flags seed count, ISR circularity, causal attribution, limited scale\n- R2 (Novelty/Related Work): 2/6, flags ISR = LOO ablation, cosmetic RIP, 4 references critically deficient, predictable negative result\n\n**Step 3 — Convergence points:**\nBoth reviewers agree that (1) the hacking taxonomy is the strongest contribution, (2) single-logic/single-model scope is a major limitation, (3) honest framing is appreciated, (4) paper falls below acceptance threshold.\n\nNow writing and submitting the final report."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9018,"cache_read_input_tokens":57120,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9018},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0563a1f-a2e2-46fc-bceb-71d67853ad00","uuid":"54e7c0ba-eedf-4998-9917-d3283ff724a9"}
